{
  "input_status": "OK",
  "stated_requirements": [
    {
      "id": "R1",
      "type": "NFR",
      "text": "The API needs to be optimized to avoid slow performance.",
      "source_quote": "The biggest issue right now is our API. It's slow. We need to optimize the query layer before adding any new features.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R2",
      "type": "FR",
      "text": "The analytics service should be its own service in a microservices architecture.",
      "source_quote": "We're moving to microservices architecture. The analytics service should be its own service, not bolted onto the monolith.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R3",
      "type": "FR",
      "text": "An index on the timestamp column of the existing events table is required.",
      "source_quote": "But it needs an index on the timestamp column - right now full table scans take 8+ seconds.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R4",
      "type": "NFR",
      "text": "The backend work will require at least 2 sprints, possibly 3 if including API redesign.",
      "source_quote": "I'd say we need at least 2 sprints for the backend work. Maybe 3 if we include the API redesign.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R5",
      "type": "FR",
      "text": "The dashboard should provide insights rather than just charts.",
      "source_quote": "Users don't want another dashboard. They want answers. Every tool we've evaluated has too many charts and not enough insights.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R6",
      "type": "FR",
      "text": "A single-page app approach should be explored.",
      "source_quote": "I'd like to explore a single-page app approach.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R7",
      "type": "NFR",
      "text": "The desktop experience should not be compromised for mobile.",
      "source_quote": "Mobile is important but I don't want to compromise the desktop experience.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R8",
      "type": "FR",
      "text": "Dark mode should be considered for implementation.",
      "source_quote": "Can we add dark mode? Users have asked for it. Not critical but would be nice.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R9",
      "type": "FR",
      "text": "A basic version of the product should be delivered by the end of March.",
      "source_quote": "Can we get something out by end of March? Even if it's basic?",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R10",
      "type": "FR",
      "text": "The product must be able to predict churn.",
      "source_quote": "Also, can it predict churn? That would be a game-changer for my team.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R11",
      "type": "FR",
      "text": "Multi-tenant support is critical for customers to see their own data.",
      "source_quote": "Customers want to see their own data, filtered by their account. Multi-tenant support is critical.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R12",
      "type": "FR",
      "text": "White-labeling options should be considered for reports.",
      "source_quote": "Some customers have asked for white-labeling - putting their own logo on reports.",
      "verbatim_values": []
    },
    {
      "id": "R13",
